{"metadata":{"title":"큐브 한붓그리기 퍼즐","category":"Cube One-Stroke Puzzle KO","categoryPathComponent":"Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO","estimatedTime":"6hr 16min","role":"overview"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO"},"kind":"overview","sections":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SpriteKit으로 작은 2D 퍼즐을 먼저 만들고, GameStore로 상태와 규칙을 분리한 뒤, 나중에 SceneKit 큐브로 확장하는 한국어 튜토리얼입니다."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"정규 트랙은 1-9장입니다. 약 100분 안에 2D SpriteKit 퍼즐을 만들고, 그 화면을 SceneKit 큐브 한 면에 붙인 뒤, 큐브 표면 터치를 tile 이름으로 바꾸는 데서 끝냅니다. 11장 이후는 더 긴 추가 단계입니다."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"큐브 한붓그리기 퍼즐","kind":"hero","action":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/01-SpriteKit-Scene-And-Container-Layers","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}],"overridingTitle":"Get started","type":"reference","isActive":true}},{"content":[],"image":null,"chapters":[{"name":"정규 트랙 A: SpriteKit 첫 화면","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI 안에 SpriteKit scene을 올리고, layer와 tile, touch 흐름을 작은 화면에서 익힙니다."}]}],"image":"chapter-spritekit.svg","tutorials":["doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/01-SpriteKit-Scene-And-Container-Layers","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/02-SpriteKit-Tiles-And-Touch-Names","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/03-Foundation-Board-Model-And-TileID","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/04-Foundation-GameStore-And-Neighbor-Rule"]},{"name":"정규 트랙 B: 상태와 큐브 첫 연결","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"tile 선택 상태를 저장하고, 2x2 board 규칙을 만든 뒤, SpriteKit face를 SceneKit 큐브에 붙이고, 큐브 표면 터치를 tile 이름으로 바꿉니다.","type":"text"}]}],"image":"chapter-foundation.svg","tutorials":["doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/05-SwiftUI-StateObject-And-Scene-Connection","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/06-SwiftUI-Undo-And-Three-By-Three","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/07-SceneKit-Cube-Material-And-Texture-Touch","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/08-SceneKit-Rotation-Mode","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/09-Cube-Touch-To-Tile-Name"]},{"name":"추가 단계: 큐브 stage 확장","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"정규 트랙 이후에 3x3 stage, face 보정, stage 전환, 자동 회전, hitTest 확인, brush anchor를 단계별로 추가합니다."}]}],"image":"chapter-scenekit.svg","tutorials":["doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/11-SpriteKit-Three-By-Three-Cube-Net","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/13-SpriteKit-SceneKit-Face-Direction-And-Texture-Correction","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/14-SpriteKit-SceneKit-Edge-Position-Transition","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/15-SceneKit-Rotation-Mode-And-Auto-Rotation","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/16-SceneKit-Hit-Test-Touch-Dot","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/17-SpriteKit-SceneKit-Brush-Anchor"]}],"kind":"volume","name":null}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[],"reference":"doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/tutorials\/cube-one-stroke-puzzle-ko"]}],"references":{"doc://com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO/tutorials/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO/1